  <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
    <name>DecorationUserEmailNotFilledIn</name>
    <id>17</id>
    <title>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Fill the user email address in the &quot;Users&quot; catalog.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>آدرس ایمیل کاربر را در فهرست &quot;کاربران&quot; تکمیل کنید.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Требуется заполнить Email пользователя (в справочнике &quot;Пользователи&quot;).</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Kullanıcı e-postasını doldurmak gerekiyor (&quot;Kullanıcılar&quot; kataloğu)</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Cần điền Email của người sử dụng (trong danh mục &quot;Người sử dụng&quot;).</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Fill the user email address in the &quot;Users&quot; catalog.</value>
    </title>
    <title>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Fill the user email address in the &quot;Users&quot; catalog.</value>
    </title>
    <visible>true</visible>
    <enabled>true</enabled>
    <userVisible>
      <common>true</common>
    </userVisible>
    <extendedTooltip>
      <name>DecorationUserEmailNotFilledInExtendedTooltip</name>
      <id>19</id>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </extendedTooltip>
    <contextMenu>
      <name>DecorationUserEmailNotFilledInContextMenu</name>
